deepin-terminal-ghostty (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add shell integration that reports running commands via OSC sequences and
    displays process-specific icons in the vertical tab sidebar.
  * Support X10/SGR/UTF-8/URxVT mouse tracking with scroll events.
  * Add startup command execution options (--command, --working-directory).
  * Install desktop file and application icon.
  * Fix CJK character stretching distortion and supplementary-plane rendering.
  * Fix transient terminal resizes that dropped visible pane content.
  * Fix text selection when dragging from bottom-right to top-left.
  * Preserve split pane layout when closing individual terminals.
  * Add app-configured terminal content padding.
  * Add CI static analysis workflow and esctest smoke coverage.

 -- Deepin Packages <packages@deepin.org>  Sat, 26 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0800

deepin-terminal-ghostty (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix multiple crash scenarios around terminal repaint and resize handling.
  * Improve CJK and supplementary-plane text rendering, including wide-character layout.
  * Add input-method support so Chinese IME composition works correctly in the terminal.
  * Rework terminal repaint scheduling and dirty-row caching to reduce UI stalls.
  * Replace the bundled libghostty-vt with a ReleaseFast build and batch PTY delivery
    to significantly improve heavy-output and TUI responsiveness.

 -- Deepin Packages <packages@deepin.org>  Thu, 23 Apr 2026 01:25:00 +0800

deepin-terminal-ghostty (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add DTK logging integration and project logging guidelines.
  * Fix transient terminal resizes that dropped visible pane content.
  * Preserve locale when spawning PTY sessions for correct UTF-8 output.
  * Configure application metadata for the DTK About dialog.
  * Add Qt input method support so terminals can switch IMEs and input Chinese.

 -- Deepin Packages <packages@deepin.org>  Tue, 21 Apr 2026 18:58:59 +0800
